# 3D models: the frontend Deployment mounts the node path
# /opt/5stack/models/cs2-model-extract (see deployment.yaml). Populate it with
# the plugin's scripts/extract-models.sh; without it, 3D rendering is simply
# unavailable.
INVENTORY_DOMAIN=inventory.5stack.gg

# Which browser origins may act as a signed-in player (backend/src/originGuard.ts),
# using the same variables as the 5stack API. ./plugin.sh fills WEB_DOMAIN and
# AUTH_COOKIE_DOMAIN from the panel on every run. By hand, only a panel that is
# not a PARENT domain of INVENTORY_DOMAIN (5stack.gg -> inventory.5stack.gg)
# needs them: a sibling host, a tunnel. A refused panel sees CORS errors
# ("must not be the wildcard '*'") in the browser; a refused POST without a
# preflight also logs "[csrf] refused".
# WEB_DOMAIN=5stack.gg
# AUTH_COOKIE_DOMAIN=.5stack.gg
# EXTRA_CORS_ORIGINS=https://panel.example.net,https://x.trycloudflare.com
